<title>CANADA: Fire reported at Imperial Oil refinery.</title>
<headline>Fire reported at Imperial Oil refinery.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Oil Ltd said on Thursday it had a fire at its Nanticoke, Ontario refinery.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The 112,000 barrel per day plant, located about 100 km (62 miles) southwest of Toronto, is Imperial's third largest refinery.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
